    "How To Build A $1M One-Person Business Faster With AI\nA practical playbook for building a trusted brand, creating valuable content, designing an offer, and using AI to accelerate execution",
    "The purpose of this playbook\nA one-person business is not a business in which one person personally performs every task forever. It is a business designed so that one capable operator can create, market, sell, deliver, and improve a valuable offer with a small amount of overhead. AI can increase that operator's capacity, shorten research and drafting cycles, and reduce avoidable guesswork.",
