        "8. Verify important claims against the source and real-world evidence.\nYou can also ask AI to turn the guide into a coach that interviews you, assigns small tasks, reviews your work, and asks you to report back.\nCoaching prompt\nUse the guide and source material I provide as the primary reference.",
        "Act as a practical coach helping me apply the method. First identify\nwhat I have already completed and what information is missing.\nThen create a sequence of small, specific tasks.",
        "For each task:\n- Explain the intended outcome.\n- Give me the steps.\n- Show what a good result should contain.\n- Ask me to complete the task before moving on.\n- Review my submission against the guide.\n- Point out weak reasoning, missing evidence, and unclear work.\n- Suggest a concrete revision.",
        "Do not pretend I have completed work that I have not shown you.\nDo not praise weak work just to be encouraging. Be constructive,\nspecific, and honest.\nThis is a more productive use of AI than asking it to generate an entire brand and then accepting the result without reflection."
